  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<div>Extended Tennessee Eastman Reference Data as presented in Reinartz et al. (2021). <br></div><div><br></div><div>The data contains simulations of 28 process faults for 6 different operating modes. Each fault is simulated 500 times with different seeds for the random number generator. <br></div><div>Additional simulations feature setpoint changes and mode transitions between the 6 operating modes. <br></div><div>All simulations have a duration of 100 hours with a sampling rate of 3 minutes.</div><div> <br></div><div>Please refer to the Readme and publication for detailed information. <br></div>",
